                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "820264c6-5810-3c79-a72c-c98a7f2869e0",
                        "entry_id": "7a34aba9-4461-3798-a8d5-5d00c807b5d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. самоутверждаться; поведение того, кто хочет показать собственную ценность, значимость и таким образом добиться соответствующего положения в обществе"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dafde019-ff37-4293-9928-85ad71d258bd",
                                "sense_id": "820264c6-5810-3c79-a72c-c98a7f2869e0",
                                "text": "В самом деле, жизнь природы вся основана на борьбе, на исключительном самоутверждении каждого существа, на внутреннем и внешнем отрицании им всех других."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c08476ed-6f18-44d0-aa94-edaceba774e3",
                                "sense_id": "820264c6-5810-3c79-a72c-c98a7f2869e0",
                                "text": "Все они признавали единственную форму самоутверждения ― конфронтацию."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "da161345-239a-4c47-b2fb-e4635f794354",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a34aba9-4461-3798-a8d5-5d00c807b5d2",
                        "source_sense_id": "820264c6-5810-3c79-a72c-c98a7f2869e0",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-affirmation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cd3a875d-fed4-481f-a5d3-d990aa347cc3",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a34aba9-4461-3798-a8d5-5d00c807b5d2",
                        "source_sense_id": "820264c6-5810-3c79-a72c-c98a7f2869e0",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-assertion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-assertion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89aab94c-5673-35a7-840a-986e310a04cb",
                                        "entry_id": "fe9a86f5-6906-3518-bcac-9db758b7c4e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The aggressive advancement of one's own opinions or wishes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e992cc05-607d-418b-980b-5104a9f97bd8",
                                                "sense_id": "89aab94c-5673-35a7-840a-986e310a04cb",
                                                "text": "If his sweet-tempered wife could have got up any self-assertion against anyone, I am satisfied it could only have been because she was the Beauty’s sister."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c1ade21-2dfa-4532-bf01-0e9c3e4ca7b7",
                                                "sense_id": "89aab94c-5673-35a7-840a-986e310a04cb",
                                                "text": "In place of ruthless self-assertion it demands self-restraint; in place of thrusting aside, or treading down, all competitors, it requires that the individual shall not merely respect, but shall help his fellows; its influence is directed, not so much to the survival of the fittest, as to the fitting of as many as possible to survive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8a9f34b-7c12-40f5-beb0-0daa9b1f7e53",
                                                "sense_id": "89aab94c-5673-35a7-840a-986e310a04cb",
                                                "text": "\"Self-assertion is foreign to my nature, but I have to hold my ground against opposition.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f08459b8-e2c0-447b-b401-944d94ce39a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a34aba9-4461-3798-a8d5-5d00c807b5d2",
